% Open book shown on bookmark buttons; GNUstep has no NSBookmarksTemplate.
1 setlinejoin
1.2 setlinewidth
0 setgray
newpath
8 1.5 moveto 5 3 2.5 3 0.8 2 curveto 0.8 11.2 lineto 2.5 12.2 5 12.2 8 10.7 curveto
11 12.2 13.5 12.2 15.2 11.2 curveto 15.2 2 lineto 13.5 3 11 3 8 1.5 curveto closepath stroke
newpath 8 1.5 moveto 8 10.7 lineto stroke
showpage
